### ============================================================================
### Fuel Wallet Backend — VS Code REST Client (api.http)
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = replace_with_clerk_session_jwt_token
@stationAId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@stationBId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@mainWalletId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@stationAWalletId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@transactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@verificationCode = 123456

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Health Check
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Identity & Wallets (Phase 1)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Authenticated User Profile & Wallets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Stations (Phase 2)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Stations (with caller's station & main balances)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List Stations Filtered by City
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations?city=الخرطوم
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Station by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/{{stationAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Top-Ups (Phase 4)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Top Up Main Wallet (30,000 SDG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-topup-0001

{
  "amount": 30000
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Transfers (Phase 5)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Transfer from Main Wallet -> Station A (20,000 SDG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-main-to-a-0001

{
  "fromWalletId": "{{mainWalletId}}",
  "to": {
    "type": "STATION",
    "stationId": "{{stationAId}}"
  },
  "amount": 20000
}

### Transfer from Station A Wallet -> Station B (8,000 SDG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-a-to-b-0001

{
  "fromWalletId": "{{stationAWalletId}}",
  "to": {
    "type": "STATION",
    "stationId": "{{stationBId}}"
  },
  "amount": 8000
}

### Transfer from Station A Wallet -> Main Wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-a-to-main-0001

{
  "fromWalletId": "{{stationAWalletId}}",
  "to": {
    "type": "MAIN"
  },
  "amount": 5000
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Payments (Phase 6)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Pay at Station A (12,000 SDG from Station A Wallet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-station-a-0001

{
  "stationId": "{{stationAId}}",
  "sourceWalletId": "{{stationAWalletId}}",
  "amount": 12000
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Transaction History & Wallet Statements (Phase 7)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Caller's Transactions (Cursor Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List Caller's Transactions Filtered by Type & Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?limit=20&type=PAYMENT&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Transaction by ID (Used to poll PENDING transactions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Wallet Ledger Statement (Cursor Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallets/{{mainWalletId}}/ledger?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Operator Tools (Phase 9 — Role: OPERATOR or ADMIN)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List COMPLETED Payments into Operator's Station
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operator/payments?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Lookup COMPLETED Payment by 6-Digit Verification Code (Last 30 Minutes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operator/payments/lookup?code={{verificationCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update Operator Station Congestion Level ('LOW' | 'MEDIUM' | 'HIGH')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/operator/station
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "congestion": "HIGH"
}

### Get Operator Station Daily Summary (Today's Total Amount & Payment Count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operator/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Admin Tools & Integrity (Phases 4 & 8 — Role: ADMIN)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Simulated Bank Gateway Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/bank-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Set Simulated Bank Gateway Status to DOWN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/bank-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DOWN"
}

### Set Simulated Bank Gateway Status to UP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/bank-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "UP"
}

### Run System-Wide Ledger & Wallet Reconciliation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Activate or Deactivate a Station
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stations/{{stationAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### Freeze or Unfreeze a User ('ACTIVE' | 'FROZEN')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

